# API Backend URL
# Local phone development: from mobile/, run `npm run start:local`.
# The launcher creates a temporary HTTPS tunnel and sets EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL
# automatically, so no Wi-Fi IP edits are needed. Keep the launcher terminal open.
# For production builds, configure EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL to the deployed API URL.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8000
